# ==============================================================================
# GUÍA RÁPIDA DE VARIABLES DE ENTORNO — PORTAL TRABAJO IT
# ==============================================================================
# El sistema se compone de dos entornos independientes:
#
# 1. FRONTEND (Vercel):
#    Consulta: frontend/.env.example
#    Variables críticas:
#      - DB_PROXY_URL, DB_PROXY_TOKEN
#      - STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
#      - REPORT_TOKEN_SECRET, REPORT_DOWNLOAD_SECRET
#      - RESEND_API_KEY, TELEGRAM_TOKEN, TELEGRAM_ADMIN_ID
#      - NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL
#
# 2. BACKEND & CRON (Raiola Networks cPanel):
#    Consulta: backend/.env.example
#    Variables críticas en backend/.env o Apache SetEnv:
#      - MYSQL_HOST, MYSQL_USER, MYSQL_PASSWORD, MYSQL_DATABASE
#      - DB_PROXY_TOKEN (debe coincidir exactamente con el de Vercel)
#      - TELEGRAM_TOKEN, TELEGRAM_CHANNEL, TELEGRAM_ADMIN_ID
#      - GEMINI_API_KEY
#      - EMAIL_USER, EMAIL_PASSWORD, SMTP_HOST
#
# 3. GITHUB ACTIONS SECRETS (Repositorio -> Settings -> Secrets):
#      - FTP_SERVER, FTP_USERNAME, FTP_PASSWORD, FTP_SERVER_DIR
#      - DATABASE_URL o MYSQL_USER, MYSQL_PASSWORD, MYSQL_DATABASE
#      - TELEGRAM_TOKEN, TELEGRAM_CHANNEL, TELEGRAM_ADMIN_ID
#      - GEMINI_API_KEY
# ==============================================================================

